  {
    "episode_id": 43208,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/3/43208.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 24,
    "turn_text": "Pat, let's start with this. You conducted another round table. I always feel like your round tables are meaningful. The last one dealt with youth sports, which we talked about. This one is the return of Major League Baseball. What can the return of Major League Baseball in your opinion due to just everyday confidence for society?",
