    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/3/43208.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 27,
    "turn_text": "One thing that was pointed out during this roundtable was how extensive the protocols happened to be. Across the board, not just players and managers, but everybody along the way. I know that you knew they were extensive, but did you realize to the extent that they decided to go and how impressed were you by that?",
