  {
    "episode_id": 43208,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/3/43208.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 29,
    "turn_text": "In fact, his quote was, these things are different and they are weird, but we knew coming in that we were going to have to accept it. And it sounds like based on the testing, because, yeah, Dr. Gary Green as well as a part of this, and he mentioned how the positive testing rate since they started has dropped.",
