        "text": "The 'other guys' force customers into vehicles they do not truly want.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "The SMC way allows customers time to browse, ask questions, and take test drives.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "The Merck family and SMC employees have prioritized customer experience for over 100 years.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Other dealers do not offer the best possible price for trade-ins despite claiming they do.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "SMC promises to offer the highest market value for a customer’s trade-in vehicle.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "SMC provides all applicable factory rebates on new vehicles.",
